# core/src/_generated/ is COMMITTED (distribution is clone/CDN, not npm — a fresh
# clone must be complete, and a CDN can only serve files that are in the repo).
# It is generated from the TRACKED example registry — never from a consumer
# registry, which would leak consumer paths. Regenerate with:
#   node core/src/cli/codegen.mjs --registry core/src/registry.v02-example.json --out core/src/_generated --quiet
core/src/_generated-v2/
